# Kernle AI

Multi-tenant B2B PIM (Akeneo-class category). Original branding/copy only — never copy competitor UI, purple palette, or marketing text.

## Stack
- Monorepo: pnpm workspaces
- `apps/web`: Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind, shadcn/ui
- `apps/api`: NestJS + TypeScript REST
- `packages/db`: Prisma + PostgreSQL
- `packages/types`: shared types
- Redis + BullMQ; S3/MinIO for DAM; Anthropic for AI; Stripe for billing

## Multi-tenancy
- Every tenant table has `organizationId`
- Use Prisma tenant extension / scoped client — never query without org context
- RBAC roles: Owner, Admin, CatalogManager, Contributor, Viewer — enforce in API guards

## AI safety
- Never auto-commit AI output to live product data
- No raw SQL from LLM — whitelisted tools only
